OL,3,GNEWSAYoung cricketers make winning trip
OL,4,Ato Lord's
OL,5,
OL,6,FA team of young cricketers from across
OL,7,Fthe West Midlands have lived out their
OL,8,Fdream of playing at "the home of
OL,9,Fcricket" - and winning.
OL,11,FMCC Coventry under-13 boys beat rivals
OL,12,FSheffield by 38 runs in the national
OL,13,Ffinal on the Nursery ground at Lord's.
OL,15,FThe competition is the showpiece of the
OL,16,FMCC Foundation National Hubs Programme,
OL,17,Fwhich trains and supports more than
OL,18,F7,000 boys and girls from state schools
OL,19,Fto play cricket.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
