OL,3,GNEWSAYoung cricketers make winning trip
OL,4,Ato Lord's
OL,5,
OL,6,FCoach Ben Chapman said: "It was a
OL,7,Freally adult and outstanding
OL,8,Fperformance from the boys. They lost a
OL,9,Fcouple of early wickets and could have
OL,10,Fpanicked, but an outstanding
OL,11,Fachievement for a bunch of 13-year
OL,12,Folds."
